-- Pooled 36 px rows: the picture at the left (the game's own icon, tinted when asked), the name
-- over a muted note (RichText), a readout at the right over a muted time. Set writes only what
-- changed; a row whose key is new at the top arrives from 6 px above its place.
-- TFF 2026-10-31 night ("last live catches z ikonkami"): the last catches with their mutation,
-- size title, weight, luck and income.
local FEED_ROW = 36
function Groupbox:AddFeed(props)
    props = props or {}
