-- Health-drop counting alone gave more hits than shots (r6 78/79, r9 36/39: DoT / pierce) and cannot show accuracy.
-- 2026-11-13: the server's own word first - CombatFx "hit" (byUserId = us) credits the arrow, the Health drop is the fallback;
-- whichever comes first credits it and the other one (the same blow) is skipped
local pending = {}
local waveHitShots, waveMiss, waveDmgDealt, waveMissLogged, waveMissBy = 0, { origin = 0, dead = 0, miss = 0, dropped = 0 }, 0, 0, {}
-- per wave: arrows credited by CombatFx / by Health, our arrows a Shielded elite blocked, blows our dash invuln ate (DodgeFx),
-- our blocks and what the server said about blows on us (playerHit blocked / parry)
local waveFx = { fx = 0, hp = 0, shield = 0, dodged = 0, blocks = 0, blocked = 0, parry = 0 }
